  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound skinless, boneless chicken thighs, quartered",
    "0.5 yellow onion, grated",
    "4 cloves garlic, minced",
    "1 teaspoon fine salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon freshly ground black pepper",
    "4 cups oil for frying, or as needed",
    "0.75 cup cornstarch",
    "0.5 cup self-rising flour",
    "1 teaspoon white sugar",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup very cold water, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u2rcHmw3aWP4gD2bcB5peEwKlqE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238844-KoreanFriedChicken-ddmfs-Step1-3x4-8711-5aa4bf59ca594850b6a6cf82ae8dd99e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238844/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make marinade: Stir together chicken, onion, garlic, salt, and pepper in a medium bowl until chicken is coated. Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate, 4 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w9KY8QLMhV3EXrcxVoOEjSY69DE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238844-KoreanFriedChicken-ddmfs-Step2-3x4-8714-3951ab5a22bc4f76b9c7ea5309ca3530.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238844/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a deep fryer or large saucepan to 340 degrees F (171 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "While oil is heating, make the batter: Whisk cornstarch, flour, sugar, pepper, and salt together in a large bowl. Gradually whisk in cold water until mixture resembles a smooth batter. Use tongs to remove chicken from marinade to batter; stir to coat chicken completely. Discard marinade.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ES4CJq8cc12Wy-JINgBoSdFWdxw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238844-KoreanFriedChicken-ddmfs-Step5-3x4-8721-65f7fe2b55064668befb136474fadbf4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238844/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in batches, fry chicken in hot oil for 4 minutes. Transfer chicken to a cooling rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EqLj-vdPL8jOkBZ7LYzTY45Ob-0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238844-KoreanFriedChicken-ddmfs-Step6-3x4-8744-186617e9dd2440509123a540f2bae669.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238844/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increase oil temperature to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in batches, fry chicken again in hot oil until golden brown and crispy, 3 to 4 minutes. Transfer to a wire rack to drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nTki3umswtxzU57C7PgL9HSL60w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/238844-KoreanFriedChicken-ddmfs-Step7-3x4-8775-07ad2c0987174d05a4a55d0e332b24a1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/238844/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
